props":{"className":"life-ad-rail","data-dock-active":"false","style":{"top":"94px"}},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-dock","hidden":true},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored life-ad-space-compact","data-ad-placement":"ad_dock","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"Advertisement · Community recommendation"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-ad-dismiss","aria-label":"Close ad"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-x","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 6 6 18"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 6 12 12"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"Official Shengcai Youshu logo","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["Advertisement · Community recommendation"]},{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Could what you know become a useful product?"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["From ebooks to small tools, explore how members spot needs and turn knowledge into something people can use."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-actions"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-link","href":"/en/shengcaiyoushu?sc_group=reading&sc_creative=read_product&sc_placement=ad_dock"},"children":["Explore the community and examples",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"18","height":"18","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M7 7h10v10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M7 17 17 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/en/book/12"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Back to index"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["Starting a business: how to protect your personal assets"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"data-ad-dock-host":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Chapter entries"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"Only invest money you can afford to lose — never use family savings or borrowed funds"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"Never sign personal guarantees for corporate loans; spouses should definitely avoid signing too"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"Choosing the right legal entity before launching: sole proprietors and general partners are fully liable, while limited liability companies offer “limited” liability"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Improperly listed shareholders: never hold shares on someone else’s behalf"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Check the Ministry of Commerce records before signing; obtain written disclosures and include a “cooling-off period” in the contract"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Determine the business name, location, scope of operations, and registered capital before registration; with complete documents, you can obtain the business license on the spot"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Businesses requiring licenses must wait until they obtain one"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Figure out which category you fall into: producing or preparing food requires a permit, selling only pre-packaged goods needs a filing, while selling fresh meat and vegetables needs no permit at all"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Packaging food for sale makes it prepackaged food: labels must include production date, shelf life, and ingredient list without exception"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/12-10","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"General foods must not claim therapeutic effects: this applies to labels, instructions, ads, and live-stream scripts alike"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"The food industry faces criminal penalties: selling meat from diseased animals or products exceeding safety limits is already a crime; adding toxic or harmful non-food substances carries a minimum five-year sentence regardless of revenue"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Once you obtain a business license, you must file tax returns on schedule — even if you have no income, you still need to submit a return with all zeros"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Invoices must reflect actual transactions; small taxpayers can fully utilize tax exemptions"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Scammers pretending to be tax officials demanding payments are fraudsters; tax filings must be done via the e-Tax Service or by calling 12366"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Writing “deposit” instead of “advance payment” in contracts, specifying penalty amounts, and treating credit terms as loans"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Sign a written contract within the first month of employment; register for social insurance within 30 days"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Wages must be paid according to contracts and laws; raises, loans, and bonuses all require written documentation"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Sell first, then produce: use pre-orders and small orders to confirm demand before investing in manufacturing"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Run the prototype through the production checklist before starting full production"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"Keep copies of invoices and supplier documentation for every shipment; avoid purchasing goods priced significantly below market rates: if an employee buys counterfeit products, the employer can still be held legally responsible"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"Whether creating designs yourself or purchasing licensed artwork, simply changing colors or adding icons does not count as “modifications” for copyright purposes"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"Follow procedures at work; think carefully about who bears responsibility before offering unsolicited help"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"Exit the process as planned when losses occur: opt for simplified deregistration when possible, or file for bankruptcy if debts exceed assets — don’t leave things unattended"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"Before paying for third‑party store management, e‑commerce training, or “dropshipping” services, be sure to ask whether extra fees will be required and where the sales figures actually come from"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/12-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"Companies and individual businesses in China must report the previous year online from January 1 to June 30, even without business activity; annual reports are free"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/12"},"children":["Chapter 12"," ·"," ","Starting a business: how to protect your personal assets"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"12-10"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["10"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["General foods must not claim therapeutic effects: this applies to labels, instructions, ads, and live-stream scripts alike"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Labels, instructions, and ads for ordinary foods must never claim that the products can prevent or treat diseases. Apart from ads for medical products, drugs, and medical devices, no other ads may make such claims or use language that sounds pharmaceutical in nature. Penalties amount to 1–3 times the advertising spend; if the spend cannot be calculated, fines range from 100,000 to 200,000 RMB. In severe cases, the business license may be revoked."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost involved. Simply review all promotional copy, prod…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The Food Safety Law states: “Labels and instructions for food and food additives must not contain false inform…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: General foods must not claim therapeutic effects: this applies to labels, instructions, ads, and live-stream scripts alike"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost involved. Simply review all promotional copy, product description pages, and live-stream scripts. The hard part is resisting the urge to use phrases like “lowers blood pressure, blood sugar, and cholesterol” or “treats constipation.”"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The Food Safety Law states: “Labels and instructions for food and food additives must not contain false information, nor may they make any claims regarding disease prevention or treatment. Producers and sellers bear full responsibility for the accuracy of such content.” Likewise, “Food advertising must be truthful and lawful; it must not contain false information or make any claims regarding disease prevention or treatment. Food producers and sellers are accountable for the veracity and legality of their ads.” In short, packaging, instructions, and ads must never assert any disease-preventive or curative effects, and sellers must accept full responsibility for any such claims. Violations of advertising rules are punished under the Advertising Law, which explicitly bans any non-medical ads from making disease-treatment claims or using medical terminology that might confuse consumers. Offenders face mandatory cessation of advertising, a public retraction of their claims, and fines ranging from 1–3 times their advertising spend; if the spend cannot be determined, fines of 100,000–200,000 RMB apply. Severe violations incur fines of 3–5 times the advertising spend, or 200,000–1,000,000 RMB, and may even result in revocation of the business license, effectively ending operations nationwide."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2025 年第三次修正). 食品安全法（第七十一、七十三、一百二十五、一百四十条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=7b5a76d0461745a08d3f964916b87ef3","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=7b5a76d0461745a08d3f964916b87ef3"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2021 年修正). 广告法（第十七、五十八条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081817ab231eb017abd6bd860052d","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081817ab231eb017abd6bd860052d"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=7b5a76d0461745a08d3f964916b87ef3","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Terms like “health benefits” are also prohibited for ordinary foods. Only foods officially registered as health supplements may make such claims, and only those listed in the national catalog are permitted. Consumers should be wary of such language; further guidance is provided in Section 6, Item 10. This regulation applies not just to physical packaging and ads, but also to online product pages, live-stream scripts, and social media posts — all of which constitute advertising material."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/12-09"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"Packaging food for sale makes it prepackaged food: labels must include production 